
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Shreya Crops Shop</title>

<style>
* {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  scroll-behavior: smooth;
}

body {
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  background: #f5fff3;
  color: #263b25;
}

header {
  background: #176b35;
  color: white;
  padding: 20px;
  text-align: center;
}

header h1 {
  font-size: 32px;
}

nav {
  background: #104d29;
  padding: 15px;
  text-align: center;
  position: sticky;
  top: 0;
  z-index: 10;
}

nav a {
  color: white;
  text-decoration: none;
  margin: 12px;
  font-weight: bold;
}

section {
  padding: 65px 20px;
  text-align: center;
  min-height: 300px;
}

.home {
  background: linear-gradient(#d9f7ce, #ffffff);
  padding: 100px 20px;
}

h2 {
  color: #176b35;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.products {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 20px;
}

.card {
  background: white;
  width: 220px;
  padding: 25px;
  border-radius: 15px;
  box-shadow: 0 3px 12px #ccc;
}

.card .emoji {
  font-size: 55px;
}

.card h3 {
  margin: 12px;
}

button {
  background: #176b35;
  color: white;
  border: none;
  padding: 12px 22px;
  border-radius: 8px;
  margin-top: 15px;
}

footer {
  background: #104d29;
  color: white;
  padding: 25px;
  text-align: center;
}

footer a {
  color: white;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
  <h1>🌾 Shreya Crops Shop 🌾</h1>
  <p>Fresh Crops | Quality Products | Best Service</p>
</header>

<nav>
  <a href="#home">Home</a>
  <a href="#about">About</a>
  <a href="#products">Products</a>
  <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
</nav>

<section class="home" id="home">
  <h2>Welcome to Shreya Crops Shop</h2>
  <p>Your Trusted Agricultural Products Shop</p>
  <p>Quality crops and fresh agricultural products.</p>
  <button onclick="location.href='#products'">
    Explore Products
  </button>
</section>

<section id="about">
  <h2>About Our Shop</h2>
  <p>
    Welcome to Shreya Crops Shop.
    We provide quality agricultural crops
    and fresh farm products.
    Our aim is customer satisfaction.
  </p>
</section>

<section id="products">
  <h2>Our Products</h2>

  <div class="products">

    <div class="card">
      <div class="emoji">🌾</div>
      <h3>Wheat</h3>
      <p>Quality Wheat</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="emoji">🍚</div>
      <h3>Rice</h3>
      <p>Fresh Rice</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="emoji">🌽</div>
      <h3>Maize</h3>
      <p>Quality Maize</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="emoji">🫘</div>
      <h3>Soybean</h3>
      <p>Good Quality Soybean</p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<section id="contact">
  <h2>Contact Us</h2>
  <p>📞 Contact Number: YOUR PHONE NUMBER</p>
  <p>📍 Address: YOUR SHOP ADDRESS</p>
  <p>🕒 Opening Hours: 9 AM - 7 PM</p>
</section>

<footer>
  <h3>Shreya Crops Shop</h3>
  <p>Thank You For Visiting Us!</p>
  <p>© 2026 Shreya Crops Shop</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
